            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"step-2-grow-the-contract-multiples-of-3\">Step 2 \u2014 Grow the contract: multiples of 3</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">We add a rule to the contract: <em>\"if <code>n</code> is a multiple of 3,\nreturn <code>'Fizz'</code>\"</em>. We first write the test (Red), then\nchange the implementation to make it pass (Green), <strong>without\nbreaking the previous test</strong> (regression).</span></span>"
          }
